Package: DataPrepUSF
Title: Simple Data Cleaning and Exploration Tools
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Saeed", "Rahman", email = "rahman29@usf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    A beginner-friendly R package designed to help users clean, summarize, 
    and explore datasets efficiently. The package provides simple functions 
    for renaming variables, checking missing values, generating summary 
    statistics, and creating quick visualizations for exploratory data analysis.
Depends: 
    R (>= 3.1.2)
Imports:
    dplyr,
    ggplot2,
    janitor
